WEBVTT

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.280
I'm sorry, Lucia.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:37.890
Huh?

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:45.060
If Mikaru is now in Mikeru's body, I can't fight with you.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:46.900
Kaito!

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:52.130
If I fight Mikeru, but it's Mikaru who gets hurt...

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:55.090
I can't do it!

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:56.040
Kaito...

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.620
I understand.

00:01:57.620 --> 00:01:59.710
But please listen to me, Kaito.

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:05.050
Even if you're not with us, we'll still fight.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:10.940
{We're going to rescue Seira, who believes that we'll save her from Mikeru!}Seira trusts that we'll save her from Mikeru, so we're going to rescue her.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:13.670
We'll fight Mikeru for {that}her.

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.030
Lucia...

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:15.920
Yeah.

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:17.450
That's because...

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:21.200
...I'm a Mermaid Princess!

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.860
To the Castle in the Sky

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:33.660
Now that I've got a complete body, I {do not}no longer need the assistance of the garbage like you!

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.210
This is wonderful!

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:50.070
{As no one can affect me now, I have the complete body!}My body is now complete, and no one will be able to stop me!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.410
Uhh, Mikeru-sama.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:55.020
Do you really have a complete body?

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.670
What? What {is the meaning of}do you mean by that?

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:03.230
That's because if {you have your complete body}you have a complete body, you should remember what I am.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.170
What did you say?

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.570
We're garbage?

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:09.970
But, you're "garbage," too!

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:12.450
We know your secret!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.770
You're just like us!

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:18.220
You were created by the Great One as well! You're just a puppet!

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:21.410
Hmph!

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:26.940
This is strange. If {he really has his complete body}his body really is complete, he would know who I am...

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.290
Could it be that Mikeru-sama still {doesn't have it}isn't complete yet?

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:34.600
Does that mean that what the Great One created {is still not sufficient}still isn't enough?

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.280
Or maybe...

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:49.070
Lucia... I...

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:51.570
I understand how you feel, Kaito.

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:52.720
Lucia...

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:55.600
From here on out, we'll each go down the path {that }we believe in.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.700
I'll do what is required of me as a Mermaid Princess.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:03:59.690
Lucia...

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.290
We should say our farewells, Kaito!

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:03.110
Lucia.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:04.360
Goodbye.

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:06.070
Lucia!

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:23.400
Masahiro.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:25.590
Rina!

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.430
I'm never going to let you go ever again.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.010
Masahiro...

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:36.260
Hold me... embrace me even tighter.

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.020
Never let me go!

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:39.830
Rina...

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:41.360
Masahiro...

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.590
Sorry for keeping you waiting, Rina.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:54.450
Masahiro.

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:57.720
Sorry for asking you out all of a sudden.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:01.520
It seems like you're going to be giving me bad news.

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:04.480
Why do you think that?

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.210
I'm sorry, but I just know.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:09.410
I just have a feeling with anything regarding you.

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:13.210
I see. I'm not going to hide it from you, then.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:18.370
Masahiro, I have to be away from this city for {the time being}a while.

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:18.930
{Eh?}Huh?

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.120
I don't know when I'll be back.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:24.240
But we'll definitely meet again, won't we?

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:26.200
I can't promise you that.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:30.690
This is just like you, Rina.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:36.640
You're a person who wouldn't make a promise if there was the possibility of it not happening.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:44.580
However, I think that there's a 100% chance that we will meet again!

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:45.570
Masahiro...

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:48.100
I'll always be thinking of you.

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.310
Masahiro, I'll always be thinking of you as well.

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:52.390
Rina...

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:53.740
Masahiro...

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.310
My goodness, Nagisa!

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:12.060
You wanted to eat ice cream on such a cold day!

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:13.910
{Isn't it all right? That's because I like it!}But I like it this way.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:18.750
Geez! You really are a little kid!

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.770
What's wrong, Hanon? Why aren't you looking at the stars?

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:28.960
{That's because }I have something {more}else worth {seeing}looking at.

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:30.900
What's that?

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:33.400
{Goodness}Geez! Can you turn {more }towards me so that I can see it better?

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:48.560
Hey, Hanon.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:49.070
Huh?

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:50.850
Is that mint chocolate chip ice cream tasty?

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:53.300
Huh? Y-Yeah, it's delicious.

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:54.710
Let me taste it.

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:55.960
Okay, go for it.

00:06:57.670 --> 00:07:00.880
I knew it. You're acting strange today, Hanon.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:01.960
Huh?

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:07.190
Normally, you wouldn't be so eager to let me taste your favorite mint chocolate chip ice cream.

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:11.600
The normal Hanon would say, "don't you want it? It's sweet and delicious!"

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:15.660
Then you'd just keep it for yourself and definitely not {give it to me}let me have any!

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.700
H-How rude! I'm not like that!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.820
Oh, no! You'd definitely not give {it to me}me any!

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:22.300
I'm not like that!

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:23.700
You are like that!

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:26.990
I'm not... like that...

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:27.660
Hanon?

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.510
That's because... that's because...

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:35.870
I love you so much, Nagisa! I love you more than mint chocolate chip ice cream!

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:38.580
You're... acting really strange, Hanon.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.310
Did something happen to you?

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:42.890
Nope, nothing's happened.

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:43.810
Hanon?

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:48.460
{I love Nagisa. Nagisa loves me as well.}I love you, and you love me, too.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.770
Therefore, nothing has happened, and nothing has changed.

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:53.690
I don't want anything to change!

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:54.550
Hanon.

00:07:56.190 --> 00:08:00.100
I don't know what happened, but don't worry! It'll be all right!

00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:04.300
Next time, let's go to the neighboring city to eat ice cream!

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:06.060
We'll ride the bicycle together again.

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:07.980
Nagisa...

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:09.430
It's a promise!

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:11.860
Okay. It's a promise!

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:39.100
I really... said goodbye to Kaito...

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:48.280
Kaito... but I really... really... really don't want to be separated from you.

00:08:48.350 --> 00:08:54.040
I want to be with... you... forever, Kaito!

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:56.140
Don't cry, Lucia.

00:08:57.210 --> 00:08:59.760
Karen! You're here!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:00.630
Of course!

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:02.290
Karen!

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:08.030
{In addition, it's not just me!}And it's not only me.

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:08.690
Huh?

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:12.980
Hi, Lucia! Tears don't suit you!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.380
Smile, Lucia!

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.910
If you do that, happiness will definitely follow!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:19.900
Coco! Noelle!

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.500
Lucia! Sorry for being late!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.210
Hanon! Rina!

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.430
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:33.960
Now everyone is here!

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:37.710
It's been so long since everyone was here together.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:40.310
If only Seira could be here...

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:44.220
Okay! Everyone, we're going to get Seira back!

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:45.090
Yeah!

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:45.700
Yep!

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:48.910
Seira, wait for us.

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:50.700
We're going to save you really soon.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:32.460
Please, tell me.

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:34.880
Were you the one that created me?

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.600
Why? Why aren't you saying anything!?

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:44.630
Are you saying that I'm still not complete?

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:47.380
{You are}That's correct, Mikeru.

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:48.630
That can't be!

00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:51.520
I've become the ultimate being!

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:59.580
Mikeru, out of all the beings in this world, there isn't one "ultimate being."

00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:02.110
You're wrong! I'm Mikeru!

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:04.230
I'm the ultimate eternal god!

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:06.450
Listen carefully, Mikeru!

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:11.070
The {support/base}foundation of this tower is buried deep in the earth.

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:16.940
It is the {foundation}base of this world,{. There is a fossil in this foundation.} and there is a fossil in it.

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:21.200
That fossil is you, Mikeru. It is your true form.

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:23.670
T-That can't be!

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:29.130
I don't believe that a fossil is my true form!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:34.060
I was a fool.

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:38.990
A fossil... is my true form...

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:44.050
Presented by Licca and Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:44.750
What's wrong, Mikeru?

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:47.760
You have such a sad expression on your face.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.070
Did something happen?

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:54.990
If you're worrying about me, why don't you curse yourself?

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:58.070
Your future is {in enslavement!}as a slave.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.890
Poor Mikeru...

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:00.780
What?

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:03.430
You have a deep wound.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.780
I understand.

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:08.450
That's because I'm so close to your heart.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:12.980
What... kind of a being am I?

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:15.450
Mikeru, you are yourself.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:21.960
I feel the warm heart you have within you.

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:26.220
It's like the kind hearts of Lucia and the others.

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:29.010
Hmph! That can't be!

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.920
Look at this!

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:37.860
This decaying fossil is my true form!

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:39.570
This fossil is your true form?

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:43.670
Do you still mean to say that I'm a being with a heart after seeing this?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.390
You have a heart.

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:46.840
Silence! I don't have one!

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:51.290
I'm no more than a decaying fossil!

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:53.170
Mikeru...

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.390
I feel sorry for you.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:59.120
You feel sorry for me!?

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:31.480
That's not possible. How could someone created from a decaying fossil have a heart?

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:34.390
You can't say that, Mikeru-sama!

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:45.260
{As long as}If you can revive that fossil, you can {restore your entire complete body.}make your body complete again.

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:49.170
But how would I go about doing that?

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:54.120
You need to get the power of all seven Mermaid Princesses.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.140
These pillars are from Mikeru!

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:12.490
What's going on?

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:15.150
This is probably Mikeru's invitation.

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:19.030
If we follow the pillars, it will definitely take us to where Seira is.

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:27.320
Let's go to Mikeru's castle!

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:32.190
What? These pillars are...

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.370
Rihito-san!

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.930
The pillars have appeared again!

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:40.800
Kaito-kun?

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:45.800
Rihito-san! That insignia is...

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:58.100
The insignia on our foreheads indicate that we are members of the Panterassa race.

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:00.140
Members of the Panterassa race?

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:07.670
Rihito-san, you, and most likely Mikaru, are {mostly likely }descendants of the Panterassa race.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:08.740
I see.

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:12.110
So that's why Mikaru was so attached to you.

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:14.940
I have to go.

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:18.180
Rihito-san, where are you going?

00:16:18.180 --> 00:16:20.250
I'm going to rescue Mikaru, of course!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:20.790
Eh?

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:25.660
Kaito-kun, I've always been afraid of losing Mikaru.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:29.310
I may have unintentially {avoided}neglected her as a result.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:31.050
Rihito-san...

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:32.780
Therefore, I have to go!

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:39.800
I'm going to use this staff that Mother {has }left behind and make sure I save Mikaru!

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:46.180
Rihito-san, I feel the same way. I'm {also }coming with you!

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:48.140
Kaito-kun...

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:49.600
Thank you!

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:04.710
This is...

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:08.460
We've landed in Mikeru's castle.

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:13.310
Even though we've been invited, why isn't there a wonderful dinner waiting for us?

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:17.770
In addition, he's so rude to have no one greet us.

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:19.280
Something's coming!

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:24.260
Mikeru!

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.400
Welcome to my castle.

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:33.140
It's a wonderful sight to see all the Mermaid Princesses together.

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:36.070
No! Seira isn't here yet!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:39.570
That's right! We seven are of one heart!

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.230
Mikeru, give Seira back!

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:44.040
Don't worry about that.

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:48.830
You all will be joining Seira inside my body.

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:51.860
That way, everyone can be together forever.

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:52.970
Quit joking around!

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:55.450
That's right! Who wants to be inside your body?

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:57.230
Everyone, let's do it!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:13.260
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:18.460
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:22.650
Green Pearl Voice!

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:26.220
Purple Pearl Voice!

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:30.890
Indigo Pearl Voice!

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.180
Yellow Pearl Voice!

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:14.250
All right, let's go!

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.070
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:44.700
{Haha! }You're all a bunch of fools!

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:47.960
You think that you can get to me with that song?

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:51.820
Now, be good girls and become part of my feathers!

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:04.170
All your healing songs are useless against me, Mermaid Princesses.

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:07.330
My fossilized self has no ears to hear them.

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:10.680
Fossilized? What {is the meaning of this?}do you mean?

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:20.990
Lucia! Lucia!

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:22.600
Seira!

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:25.630
Lucia, thank you for coming to rescue me.

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:30.070
Hey, Seira! What do we need to do in order to {rescue}save you?

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:35.020
Lucia, please{! You need to} destroy that fossil by any means necessary.

00:21:35.430 --> 00:21:37.420
Huh? Destroy a fossil?

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:40.740
Mikeru's true form is at the bottom of this castle.

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:43.980
That fossil is Mikeru's true form?

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:46.890
What's going on, Seira?

00:21:46.890 --> 00:21:49.060
Please! Destroy it!

00:21:49.060 --> 00:21:51.260
It's something that should no longer exist.

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:53.500
Please, Lucia!

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:01.820
I'm Mikeru, the being that is the savior of this world!

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:06.440
Now I'm going to have my perfect body and become an eternal god!

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:12.800
Kaito!

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:16.470
Save me, Kaito!

00:23:52.680 --> 00:23:55.520
{Haha! }A puppet is still a puppet in the end.

00:23:55.520 --> 00:23:58.480
And now this puppet Mikeru is no longer needed.

00:23:58.480 --> 00:23:59.700
What are you saying?

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:01.510
Who in the world are you?

00:24:01.510 --> 00:24:03.910
I'm the messenger of an ancient race.

00:24:03.910 --> 00:24:09.270
I was tasked to revive that ancient race on this {planet (?)}world.

00:24:09.270 --> 00:24:10.550
What are you saying?

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:14.040
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:14.040 --> 00:24:15.500
The Battle on Christmas Eve.

00:24:15.500 --> 00:24:19.010
Our song is for the sake of Mikaru and Mikeru!
